WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.604
To go deeper, start with the executive
briefing for Orientation and Program,

2
00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:07.712
which lays out the decisions
with owners and timing.

3
00:00:07.712 --> 00:00:12.813
Chapter 12 of The Transformation Arc is
the roadmap, with every phase and gate.

4
00:00:12.813 --> 00:00:16.921
Identity and Directory covers
identity and the directory,

5
00:00:16.921 --> 00:00:21.449
and HR-Driven Identity makes the
full case for HR-driven identity.

6
00:00:21.449 --> 00:00:26.512
Every claim in this briefing is footnoted
to a primary source in those books.

7
00:00:26.512 --> 00:00:32.312
The workbook is independent analysis, not
an official publication of any agency.

8
00:00:32.312 --> 00:00:33.820
Thank you for starting here.
